WEBVTT

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:01.292
because I know for a fact
that it has helped people.

00:11:05.292 --> 00:11:07.083
And I just want to live in a world

00:11:08.917 --> 00:11:11.768
where, regardless
of what I wear or what I post,

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:16.833
that I'm still worthy of being treated
with dignity and respect.

00:11:19.125 --> 00:11:20.375
Respect.

00:11:21.167 --> 00:11:23.500
Now, that's an idea worth sharing.

00:11:24.042 --> 00:11:25.226
(Applause)

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.518
Thank you.

00:11:26.542 --> 00:11:32.667
(Applause)